0,East Frisian Low Saxon - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/East_Frisian_Low_Saxon,"Indo-European. Germanic.East Frisian Low Saxon, also known as East Frisian Low German or simply (but ambiguously) East Frisian, is a Northern Low Saxon dialect spoken in the East Frisian peninsula of northwestern Lower Saxony.","Saxon, East Frisian Low",Indo-European
